  "body": "If a homeserver goes offline, it may miss events. There is then no reliable means for it to catch up. Currently we rely on someone else sending an event in the room, which will then make it do a backfill.\r\n\r\nPotential solutions include:\r\n* Proactively sending the data once we hear the server is back online (#2526)\r\n* Making /pull work properly, and use it (#2527)\r\n",
